Captured before removing the clear line in homebrew.slice.ts cleanup.

$ npx vitest run src/stores/homebrew/__tests__/homebrew.slice.test.ts
FAIL homebrew listener teardown > keeps a mounted expansion and its rules after listener cleanup
AssertionError: expected [] to include 'mounted_e2e'
  at homebrew.slice.test.ts:104

The assertion fires immediately after unsubscribe(), confirming that
`getState().rules.setExpansionIds([])` in the teardown clears the mounted
expansion. The pre-teardown assertions (ids present and mounted move in
moveMaps) passed.
